Package: design.matrix
Type: Package
Title: Exact and Fast Model Matrices
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-11-25
Authors@R: c(
    person("Vincent", "Arel-Bundock", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "vincent.arel-bundock@umontreal.ca",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2042-7063")),
    person("R Core Team", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Port of modelmatrix() from R's stats package"))
Description: Builds model matrices that are identical, bit for bit, to those
    returned by 'stats::model.matrix()', with a multi-threaded fill, reusable
    plans for repeated calls on new data, and products with the design or
    with Jacobians (X beta, X'w, X'X, diag(J V J')) and least squares QR
    decompositions computed from factor codes and numeric variables without
    forming the dense matrix.
